      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Any weapon a charau-ka throws gains the deadly <d6> weapon trait. Furthermore, when a charau-ka throws an improvised weapon, they do not take the –2 penalty for doing so, nor does they take a penalty for using a thrown improvised weapon with the nonlethal trait to make a lethal attack."
